What the signals borrow
-----------------------

The method is assembled from published work and the provenance is recorded in
`msrc/signals.py` and the README. Those citations are to papers and techniques,
not to redistributed code: no source from SelfCheckGPT, Semantic Entropy,
LLM-Check, SAPLMA or any other project is vendored here.
